        <link>https://tien-kou.shunf4.workers.dev/fakefake//TheDesk/MegaPost%EF%BC%9AFolklore/2025-11-08_13.20.15</link>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">tien-kou-https://tien-kou.shunf4.workers.dev/-e1-guarded/TheDesk/MegaPost：Folklore/2025-11-08_13.20.15</guid>
        <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 13:20:15 +0800</pubDate>
        <description><![CDATA[


<div class="sole-content-wrapper">
  <div class="principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-Hans">
    <div>
      <span class="tag-wrapper"><a target="_blank" class="tag-link" href="/tag/TIL">#TIL</a></span>
    </div><p>总之目前GTK WebKit在NVIDIA显卡上是无法开箱即用的，这甚至影响到了Debian MATE默认的yelp帮助程序。</p>
<p>于是又有了如下咒语：</p>
<pre><code>WEBKIT_DISABLE_COMPOSITING_MODE=1
</code></pre>
<p>或者</p>
<pre><code>WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1
</code></pre>


</div>

  </div>
</div>
